      "body": "## Background\n\nIntegrate the merged implementation from [FW-CI-templates #592](https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/FW-CI-templates/pull/592), following the caller migration in #7935 without modifying that PR.\n\n## What changed\n\nPin `_code_freeze.yml` to `61445a177938967f70c94094b98402e979452151`. Pass `vars.BOT_ID` and `secrets.BOT_KEY`, replace the caller's PAT mapping, preserve the `main` environment, and limit GITHUB_TOKEN to contents: read.\n\n## Details\n\nDispatch inputs, version settings, `core_` branch prefix, dry-run guards, and Slack mappings are unchanged. Other workflows' PAT secrets remain untouched.\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n  Caller[Code freeze dispatch] --> Template[Merged template]\n  Template --> Branch[App token: release branch and label]\n  Branch --> Bump[Fresh App token: version-bump PR]\n```\n\n## Tested\n\n- Exact-head detached worktree validation against synchronized upstream: pre-commit completed; Python hooks correctly skipped this YAML-only change.\n- Unique-key YAML parsing, authentication/preservation assertions, and git diff --check passed.\n- Signature and matching DCO verified; live fork head confirmed.\n- Actionlint unavailable: binary downloads denied. Product/GPU tests excluded because product code and dependencies are unchanged. Full GitHub checks pending; no production freeze or protected-branch smoke test dispatched.",
